msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The White-Haired Girl turned toward Michel to press him for more information, but "
"he averted his gaze."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi si voltò verso Michel per esortarlo a darle "
"ulteriori informazioni, ma lui evitò il suo sguardo."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1F5C2A12_B0D4_494D_A3B2_985FDD6108FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85348e9f97585c24ab58fa38a7236581b5187cb64871118cbe5f11f6340dbb12
#. default-sha256: 96ea795f3f2cf7dfceef70aa303c83190e8511752a32d743bc1532431bc15280
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1F5C2A12_B0D4_494D_A3B2_985FDD6108FD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Find the answer yourself,” he seemed to be saying. ⟪k:1⟫She took several moments to gather "
"her will, then marched over to the door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sembrava volesse dire, “Cerca la risposta da sola”.⟪k:1⟫ Si prese qualche attimo per trovare "
"coraggio, e a quel punto si diresse verso la porta."

#: scenario4:scenario4_15A49AA1_107C_48B3_B095_397163E1A457
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
