msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫(So bright...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫(Quanta luce...)"

#: scenario4:scenario4_BBCC5ABA_4508_42BE_9184_261D959B28C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00cdfecc05648517061a28a4e9cfdfa6a7a8cc6db491627da9d47c45ef1bac86
#. default-sha256: 82487674ffa26e0bdbc6e446f287d70523c8fb033bc115e680a77c77138576c5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BBCC5ABA_4508_42BE_9184_261D959B28C3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sunlight—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫which she had not seen in some time—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫was so bright it seemed "
"to burn her eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La luce del sole—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫che non vedeva da diverso tempo—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫era così forte da "
"sembrarle di avere gli occhi in fiamme, sebbene il sole in sé non fosse diventato più luminoso."

#: scenario4:scenario4_EBBBBC96_08D4_4E6A_81C7_FE950D58835E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24260cabbea0fee8d26559f97c82ebd12171839eed4a823090e5466fff87f13a
#. default-sha256: a19f484c47d0891130b3acbab8b0f132469deab2fdbd47586d5b86b7b4c51101
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EBBBBC96_08D4_4E6A_81C7_FE950D58835E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Although the sun itself had not gotten any brighter—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫she had simply spent so much "
"time in the dark her eyes were no longer accustomed to that much light."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Aveva semplicemente passato così tanto tempo nel buio che non era più abituata a tutta "
"quella luce."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1743A20C_19DF_476A_BE0E_CF317A931797
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: efd6c47d071a9e555a7cf10b8f79f88fd6f0ca038ca2d9f665b1c26aa668d853
#. default-sha256: 7cf0f4c7c89f20a3322da8e952a55bcda1f87fd2608b9a5beedbf2e681d838ba
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1743A20C_19DF_476A_BE0E_CF317A931797"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The color of her eyes made them quite sensitive to light already, so when she stepped "
"outside, her whole world went bone white."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il colore dei suoi occhi li rendeva già piuttosto sensibili, perciò appena mise piede fuori, "
"il suo mondo si fece interamente bianco."

#: scenario4:scenario4_C2786865_DC4D_41E8_BA59_715BA2D60274
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: afff5a2f779257a081f002da639ade257358ec616c91a312ac1a7228286932ae
#. default-sha256: 268635d3d6be1a93e885102671ffff3222c5822ff2dad98986522208c1158fad
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C2786865_DC4D_41E8_BA59_715BA2D60274"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl stood motionless for ten, perhaps fifteen seconds, and when her eyes "
"had finally adjusted to the light—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi rimase immobile per dieci, forse quindici secondi, e una "
"volta che i suoi occhi si furono abituati al chiarore—"

#: scenario4:scenario4_A72FFAAD_4018_4430_967A_B3065CE21D7F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2fd78fb3c7a013fcc41d361fb4d2b5baf04a2a186edfdef2a4eeb365d4b08ba
