msgid "⟪k:0⟫What’s this?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E questo cos’è?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_B85D4CF8_390C_4F86_8442_7FC33CDC2D4F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e06b1eefb43bb60b4f76a6686680a105a079d12e2919c01b0420c978d99de5f
