msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B85D4CF8_390C_4F86_8442_7FC33CDC2D4F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—she noticed a crate on the ground at her feet."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫—notò un baule ai suoi piedi."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E18C489C_F90A_45D4_A4F9_5E1E586BC899
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7585cc7f353727ddd7d39d03ae30728cf82f96e51ae7ce2f01b35d6bd3ece907
#. default-sha256: 2cd1ac79df7d22de88407a8341296731acff5276c2dd59aec04802a73910c06b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E18C489C_F90A_45D4_A4F9_5E1E586BC899"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She turned her head back to ask Michel about the box, but the mansion was so dark it "
"appeared to be wholly severed from the outside world."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si girò verso Michel per chiedergli della cassa, ma la villa era così buia che pareva del "
"tutto separata dal mondo esterno."

#: scenario4:scenario4_EB040506_815D_4D74_B184_D62A6E716113
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5aa9ba636b411ad8e38f0b40f73d8b07af7662902a5390c3ba5750084346adfb
#. default-sha256: fd91442e3b2d2254b971ce1159471c8d69b09feed2141c82c920d85d908395dc
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EB040506_815D_4D74_B184_D62A6E716113"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫From where she stood, she was unable to distinguish Michel from the shadows."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Dalla sua posizione, non era in grado di scorgere Michel nell’ombra."

#: scenario4:scenario4_54251AF9_3BA8_4E58_A34A_F13A62645D3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5077d8a5eab2f17a2f235f1b755a6491acafe836f02c495f09e7eb79985cebdb
#. default-sha256: c5090966443ce458b90783aff9845e6224b512129efb57c30926899b8d0d73bf
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54251AF9_3BA8_4E58_A34A_F13A62645D3F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A pang of nervousness struck her; ⟪k:1⟫she wanted to return to that darkness as quickly as "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Venne presa da un certo nervosismo;⟪k:1⟫ voleva tornare in quell’oscurità⟪k:2⟫il più "
"velocemente possibile."

#: scenario4:scenario4_3D73C680_7370_4AE8_B1E0_CE4E6095C60F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3551420cbf1837440f7c7c2e1e3f02b40af10c8c6cffdbe2ee3852c7eaae4b9
#. default-sha256: 6fb61bc76de97518f527cc6cd39864a4a1947ffe72b9feba3f7dfa913411977a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3D73C680_7370_4AE8_B1E0_CE4E6095C60F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl had come to yearn for that world without light more than the one with."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi era arrivata al punto da desiderare quel regno privo di luce "
"più del mondo che ne era provvisto."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E1152686_7214_4F5E_82C2_746A5CD16163
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de56877c21503c8ad7ef52440771864bc938336b962973e404022a70c25210e2
