msgid "⟪k:0⟫But eventually, she did manage to drag it through the front door,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma alla fine, riuscì a trascinarlo fino al portone principale,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_5433C595_A6E1_4BA2_B1F7_5C6DDF64A6EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 81cd39c034faaae5e21e6ea6310158d65dc8091e87977b73581c7130111ccdf1
